      "statement": "The Tauri updater is configured to create updater artifacts, verify them with its configured public key, use the GitHub `latest.json` endpoint, and use passive installation on Windows; the release action is supplied the corresponding signing private-key secrets and prefers NSIS in updater JSON.",
