      "id": "claim_1d85a3b8e7a047cd838fe87c716993df",
      "statement": "Release-channel resolution recognizes only `store` as non-default: the Rust backend compiles `LYMIC_RELEASE_CHANNEL` into the binary and otherwise returns `github`, exposes it via `get_release_channel`, while the frontend reads `VITE_LYMIC_RELEASE_CHANNEL` then `LYMIC_RELEASE_CHANNEL` with the same fallback.",
