      "id": "claim_3197786fa47d42429fad0fca9b950b34",
      "statement": "After the publish matrix, tagged releases conditionally update the external `lymic-bin` AUR repository: when `AUR_SSH_PRIVATE_KEY` is configured, the job downloads the versioned Debian release asset, computes its checksum, updates PKGBUILD and .SRCINFO from repository templates, and commits only a real diff; otherwise it explicitly skips.",
